The bundle lifecycle — download, staging, atomic install, pointer management,
rollback, watchdog and retention — derives from that work. Graft replaces the
Capawesome Cloud client with a self-hosted channel protocol, moves the active
bundle pointer out of Capacitor's own preferences so the WebView loads exactly
once, and adds per-file binary deltas.

See UPSTREAM.md for the pinned fork point and the rebase procedure.
